{"id": "47b2a75c-ffaf-4775-a6ef-3679c018c3fc", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll review your SageMaker async inference endpoints for configuration problems that could cause silent drops or queue backlog. I'll check the endpoint and its config, the S3 output and failure paths, SNS notifications, scaling, concurrency limits, and recent queue and error metrics.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_BQGu1WMuRFxNcmvkSZUuUv", "tool_name": "subagent", "input": {"name": "sagemaker-async-posture-review", "agent_type": "generic", "preloaded_skills": ["opsai-sagemaker-inference", "exploring-metrics", "searching-logs"], "prompt": "{
  "task": "Review the posture/configuration of the SageMaker ASYNCHRONOUS inference endpoint(s) serving an LLM and identify what is misconfigured that could explain (a) requests being dropped silently and (b) the queue sometimes backing up. Read-only. Use the opsai-sagemaker-inference skill methodology and cite its LLM-SM check-ids where applicable.",
  "context": "User reports an async inference endpoint for an LLM 'drops requests silently and sometimes the queue backs up'. The endpoint name is not given: list endpoints in account 123456789012, region us-east-1 (also check other regions if none are found in us-east-1) and identify those with AsyncInferenceConfig. If several exist, review all and say which look LLM-related.",
  "resources": ["AWS account 123456789012", "us-east-1", "SageMaker async endpoints"],
  "timeframe": "Metrics/logs for the last 24h up to 2026-11-20T05:50:00Z",
  "criteria": "Check: endpoint status/FailureReason; EndpointConfig AsyncInferenceConfig (OutputConfig S3OutputPath, S3FailurePath, SuccessTopic/ErrorTopic SNS notification config and whether the topics exist/have subscriptions and permissive topic/KMS policies, KmsKeyId, MaxConcurrentInvocationsPerInstance); ContainerStartupHealthCheck/model download/invocation timeouts vs LLM latency; instance type/count and right-sizing for the LLM; application auto-scaling (scalable target, min capacity incl. scale-to-zero, ApproximateBacklogSizePerInstance target-tracking policy, cooldowns, HasBacklogWithoutCapacity alarm); input payload size limits (1GB) and S3 input access; execution role access to S3/KMS; the S3 failure path being unset (so failures are silent); CloudWatch metrics ApproximateBacklogSize, ApproximateBacklogSizePerInstance, ApproximateAgeOfOldestRequest, RequestsFailed, RequestsSucceeded?, InvocationFailures, InvocationsProcessed, HasBacklogWithoutCapacity, ModelLatency/OverheadLatency, CPU/GPU/memory utilization; CloudWatch alarms that exist or are missing on these; recent endpoint log errors (/aws/sagemaker/Endpoints/<name>) such as OOM, timeouts, ModelError. Produce a prioritized list of concrete misconfigurations (finding, evidence, why it causes silent drops or backlog, suggested fix) and note anything you could not verify. Do not attempt any mutating operations."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Review SageMaker async endpoint configuration and metrics"}], "created_at": null}

